    {
      "id": "61e6ad4eadf4eecbaecc70f785f56d6c583e023fd52dd4dfb2eac7ff744e3f62",
      "text": "Personal software is INSANE in the age of AI",
      "hash": "81634f3dc1c8467ebe5925ba88e5bafeccb90ac2a80ac3db4018d839a4a7b743"
    },
    {
      "id": "c97668241f7897cac19aba4d7bf5f86a776a5abb622fab7ec6371898823d2cd6",
      "text": "Don't delegate your thinking to LLMs. Use AI for grunt work in personal software built for your workflow. Keep the judgment for yourself.",
      "hash": "730c5d1cf614ecfcb92ce437779140981a9cb1bf6a69c06ea78d97c7192b2230"
    },
    {
      "id": "eda2680ec12e62606d8792876ab2df7ec132b712d439b88407ce6230506fc90a",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "d37d3aac1f290a21d0d8977dc0c318f8484fe2b84491da59899838961c4601a3",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "85aae4d220c62b89e98776c0d66f38389cb33a971e6a6c754609e7422de50e0f",
      "text": "Source Code",
      "hash": "bc47da663d101bfc1d4edcb3762f37fbe8fab3e931cfd460c69cb432b806d419"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11aeefb3a196447410d8aa87628380db3b81d97a0393a640d229f4fc6cdc04b",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "83c764b1dea50837e246d9d02fff3df5d8ddc4bed03d59f800a3bdc309f24424",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "af61d5d3f111a79f8d0a9e1e40c5e694cc975bc57eb9f3cf0dc175fd0e984c2a",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ff90ce159a83939ffa3928d63886ddd0d6b263eb7462f118b31b0ec92932df5",
      "text": "AI Handles the Grunt Work",
      "hash": "275f2d8b4d9867a161d1f4bb6da57f7fbd1a96df35b152485675f177a87344d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "37caaf5a59c96af0a380f77abb42cade5b095e88e7c9b69ac200faf4c909037b",
      "text": "Personal Software That Knows Your Workflow",
      "hash": "23f5a96e69f8cdb863bdae28f2423b4e54458ff95b68f2b88e72516bfd71621e"
    },
    {
      "id": "0866a7ced3cbd59f1370105d484f901aecafb117ee5c239842bc774fb4d16222",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b99dd64ac3a7074b9e598faa403486dea83a8c40e66ae4e183dbb191a5980b4",
      "text": "I built a personal course video manager. It handles 105 videos across 41 lessons for my courses. Nothing fancy. Just software adapted to exactly how I work.",
      "hash": "cfa53d8353533c498aaa2906cc2194426945a8c676d0392de3dfa7c066fb7ac6"
    },
    {
      "id": "58d57c8bdf412e43356e87a3840c9726ec323590fa1810491e78de0984fbd5d8",
      "text": "Here's what it does: I record a video. The app grabs the transcript and the local files I used during recording. I select an LLM (usually Haiku 4.5), choose the output format (steps to complete, skill building text, whatever), and hit go.",
      "hash": "1a5dc66a80f57209411a738a199bff869d57649470b27da869731354ba50609d"
    },
    {
      "id": "04503f18bb2b24ecd9b8039df80ed4a557f64d90d3efb2946c1734c7b39e1f1e",
      "text": "The LLM churns out accompanying text that I review and either save directly to the repo as a README or copy to my clipboard. Then I can immediately turn that transcript into an article or edit the video description.",
      "hash": "568586d7e1cfed9e938e02a07af23776b3df98fa506bf85c881d0fd773f912f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "758445736b3aa212a43e66638173c0b23639cbd0a42497c242e1b6f44113a092",
      "text": "The whole workflow lives in one place. I recorded this article's source video in the same software I'm describing right now.",
      "hash": "2b47ba7db22bdb59198924d0f9eeb2c6488da7274a2338be2fb256b56704f98f"
    },
    {
      "id": "71e6e0ffcd475f9357dcc8cf0d70d8713fa165b0ea00632ae07e22e804b6a31d",
      "text": "I have zero interest in making this a commercial application. I'm showing you this because it demonstrates something critical about AI-powered personal software.",
      "hash": "87a7e85e6387b711354c29ad428367536b504c171ce031233ed3cad183be4857"
    },
    {
      "id": "61d0f09de1ee031e1c3a77799e4f5bd794837de4801c67f11a3de045e175f765",
      "text": "Everything the AI touches in my workflow is pure grunt work. Transcription. Text generation. Repurposing content from one format into another.",
      "hash": "b2501efdeafefa78b33f8106ce708ce480cbe67fc4f7bb8537a4969f362dec49"
    },
    {
      "id": "48688ebf2ad48334247d0ee08be1f95e51316f503c52393c05ee97ea6a1308c4",
      "text": "I'm not delegating any of my thinking to the LLM. I review all of its outputs closely—at least the stuff my users see.",
      "hash": "6dd9453ee6fa1fb39fc0d82aff2d66d0db78bdb6d2da981e02cd188737fd3859"
    },
    {
      "id": "098e91fe0ccab318a1c1bd190edd8bf0ddec23ff5e5082a9806bf6feaffcaa12",
      "text": "The moment you start delegating your thinking to an LLM, you're screwed.",
      "hash": "7139cf6181c5adab882fcbb6bac1020e284f4184c55d912611b1835a02831698"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9b2cd1c9be612269104347743793dbba6059620530bd4079e4848720188f3cf",
      "text": "But if you build a system that integrates AI into workflows you already have? That's when it gets powerful.",
      "hash": "99bd94595f890ece5d9f4bcfdb1a3c93b12cb1b014d55f76551547a8244c5682"
    },
    {
      "id": "91c74d9df08e6b5c8a416ce3da2d4ed13a345d205c712d1740fc70ab8e47abf0",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e1f2bc8ae33bfa9b193a0c509d37c200b26dcfa46370928883cbe1372f0d338",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0e4d2625959217147a95a49ed849602c72e4a2b60db686d8d724e757f6736c6",
      "text": "Generic AI tools make impressive demos. They fall flat in daily use because they don't know who you are, what you're working on, or how you work.",
      "hash": "e8c3c2cece7210523c9204b27aafbfc63bd42a570a701e71053b6be0cc642ada"
    },
    {
      "id": "b13115bbd29027bd754a0bd1bfb9d43f65d7f3c1e858fc8114eb0e110d04c981",
      "text": "My course manager is optimized for me. It knows my file structure. It understands my content formats. It plugs into my existing repos.",
      "hash": "23ffa897ad5be4b61adf10e539b2a182db0df9405216768d30c131d09475ce04"
    },
    {
      "id": "46725b3d88abaafde0d09d27b2c6cf98ec82445ddc01d79f407808117d560249",
      "text": "That's the future I'm betting on. Not generic tools everyone uses the same way. Bespoke applications that deeply integrate with your specific needs and projects.",
      "hash": "d9059989e9dc41e2ff5190ae72df2897c84156c68577a2533d16387f8c69aeb6"
    },
    {
      "id": "52a7ebb27ce5e44392ff33b15a3ebe82deca6cc17b5ca944f9905e317eccf93b",
      "text": "The AI helps me move faster. It doesn't replace my judgment. It takes work off my hands without taking over my thinking.",
      "hash": "95964e5650759009a352045413d6b518980f8a9d60d25231ccf3e8a2f513a524"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac319448fc7a2fb48c47cde66c9e4e74feb2b3be0fd694d158eb8250e8482e85",
      "text": "Build systems that leverage AI for the repetitive stuff. Keep the thinking for yourself.",
      "hash": "211c8677078b3da0493b428e4db99f8161653c70c029d1d5f021d7cfb8d89b15"
    },
